in UTC Time";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:29:"硬體時鐘採用 UTC 時間";}s:24:"Hardware Virtualization:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:16:"硬體虛擬化:";}s:6:"HyperV";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"HyperV";}s:4:"ICH9";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:4:"ICH9";}s:3:"KVM";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"KVM";}s:6:"Legacy";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"遺產";}s:2:"MB";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:2:"MB";}s:7:"Minimal";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"極簡主義";}s:11:"Motherboard";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"主機板";}s:7:"Network";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"網路";}s:4:"None";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"無";}s:7:"Optical";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"光學的";}s:5:"PIIX3";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:5:"PIIX3";}s:55:"Page Fusion currently not supported by VirtualBox 7.2.x";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:47:"VirtualBox 7.2.x 目前不支援 Page Fusion。";}s:29:"Paravirtualization Interface:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"半虛擬化介面：";}s:9:"Processor";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"處理器";}s:13:"Processor(s):";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"處理器：";}s:22:"Reset Secure Boot Keys";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"重置安全啟動金鑰";}s:11:"Secure Boot";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"安全啟動";}s:3:"TPM";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"TPM";}s:14:"Use Native API";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:16:"使用原生 API";}}}s:20:"UIMachineSettingsUSB";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:12:{s:16:"Add Empty Filter";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"加入空的篩選器";}s:22:"Add Filter From Device";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"從裝置加入篩選器";}s:11:"Edit Filter";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"編輯篩選器";}s:21:"Enable USB Controller";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:20:"啟用 USB 控制器";}s:16:"Move Filter Down";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"下移篩選器";}s:14:"Move Filter Up";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"上移篩選器";}s:13:"New Filter %1";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"新過濾器 %1";}s:13:"Remove Filter";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"移除篩選器";}s:25:"USB 1.1 (OHCI) Controller";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"USB 1.1 (OHCI) 控制器";}s:25:"USB 2.0 (EHCI) Controller";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"USB 2.0 (EHCI) 控制器";}s:25:"USB 3.0 (xHCI) Controller";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"USB 3.0 (xHCI) 控制器";}s:18:"USB Device Filters";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"USB裝置過濾器";}}}s:33:"UIMachineSettingsUSBFilterDetails";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:13:{s:3:"Any";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"任何";}s:13:"Manufacturer:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"製造商：";}s:5:"Name:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"名稱:";}s:2:"No";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"否";}s:5:"Port:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"港口：";}s:11:"Product ID:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"產品編號：";}s:8:"Product:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"產品：";}s:7:"Remote:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"偏僻的：";}s:9:"Revision:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"修訂：";}s:11:"Serial No.:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"序號：";}s:18:"USB Filter Details";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"USB 篩選器詳細資料";}s:10:"Vendor ID:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"供應商 ID：";}s:3:"Yes";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"是";}}}s:15:"UIMessageCenter";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:62:{s:111:"<b>Note:</b> this interface may be in use by one or more virtual network adapters belonging to one of your VMs.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:106:"<b>注意：</b>此介面可能被您的某個虛擬機器的一個或多個虛擬網路介面卡使用。";}s:70:"<nobr>%1</nobr><br><nobr>%2 since %3</nobr><br><nobr>Session %4</nobr>";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:67:"<nobr>%1</nobr><br><nobr>%2 自 %3</nobr><br><nobr>會話 %4</nobr>";}s:75:"A file named <b>%1</b> already exists. Are you sure you want to replace it?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:65:"名為 <b>%1</b> 的檔案已存在。您確定要替換它嗎？";}s:13:"ACPI Shutdown";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:11:"ACPI 停工";}s:179:"After it is removed, these adapters will no longer be usable until you correct their settings by either choosing a different interface name or a different adapter attachment type.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:144:"移除後，這些適配器將無法再使用，直到您透過選擇不同的介面名稱或不同的適配器連線類型來修正其設定。";}s:83:"Are you sure you want to discard the saved state of the following virtual machines?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:60:"您確定要丟棄以下虛擬機器的已儲存狀態嗎？";}s:4:"Back";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"後退";}s:6:"Cancel";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"取消";}s:87:"Cannot create the machine folder <b>%1</b> in the parent folder <nobr><b>%2</b>.</nobr>";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:83:"無法在父資料夾 <nobr><b>%2</b> 中建立機器資料夾 <b>%1</b>。 </nobr>";}s:11:"Choose disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"選擇磁碟";}s:20:"Choose existing disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"選擇現有磁碟";}s:5:"Close";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"關閉";}s:8:"Continue";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"繼續";}s:15:"Create new disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"建立新磁碟";}s:6:"Delete";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"刪除";}s:16:"Delete all files";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"刪除所有檔案";}s:93:"Deleting this host-only network will remove the host-only interface this network is based on.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:72:"刪除此僅主機網路將移除此網路所基於的僅主機介面。";}s:7:"Details";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"詳細資料";}s:7:"Discard";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"捨棄";}s:63:"Do you really want to power off the following virtual machines?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:42:"您確定要關閉以下虛擬機器嗎？";}s:59:"Do you really want to reset the following virtual machines?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:42:"您確定要重設以下虛擬機器嗎？";}s:85:"Do you really want to send an ACPI shutdown signal to the following virtual machines?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:63:"您確定要傳送 ACPI 關閉訊號給下列虛擬機器嗎？";}s:79:"Do you want to remove the (host-only network) interface <nobr><b>%1</b>?</nobr>";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:71:"您是否要移除（僅主機網路）介面<nobr><b>%1</b>？ </nobr>";}s:61:"Do you want to remove the NAT network <nobr><b>%1</b>?</nobr>";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:54:"您是否要移除 NAT 網路<nobr><b>%1</b>？</nobr>";}s:124:"Doing this will also remove the files containing the machine's virtual hard disks if they are not in use by another machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:108:"這樣做也會刪除包含該機器虛擬硬碟的檔案（如果這些檔案未被其他機器使用）。";}s:82:"Failed to send the ACPI Power Button press event to the virtual machine <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:70:"無法將 ACPI 電源按鈕按事件傳送到虛擬機器 <b>%1</b>。";}s:122:"Failed to update Guest Additions. The Guest Additions installation image will be mounted to provide a manual installation.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:84:"更新增強功能失敗。將掛載增強功能安裝鏡像以進行手動安裝。";}s:7:"Go Back";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"回去";}s:230:"If this network is in use by one or more virtual machine network adapters these adapters will no longer be usable until you correct their settings by either choosing a different network name or a different adapter attachment type.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:207:"如果此網路正被一個或多個虛擬機器網路介面卡使用，則這些適配器將無法再使用，直到您透過選擇不同的網路名稱或不同的適配器連線類型來修正其設定。";}s:96:"If you proceed your current keys will be rewritten. You may not be able to boot this VM anymore.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:96:"如果繼續操作，您當前的密鑰將被覆蓋。您可能無法再啟動此虛擬機器。";}s:4:"Keep";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"保持";}s:12:"Keep changes";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"保留變更";}s:11:"Leave empty";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"留空";}s:4:"Next";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"下一個";}s:2:"No";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"否";}s:2:"OK";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"確定";}s:2:"Ok";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"正常";}s:7:"Release";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"發布";}s:15:"Reload settings";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"重新載入設定";}s:6:"Remove";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"移除";}s:11:"Remove only";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"只移除";}s:41:"Replacing it will overwrite its contents.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:30:"替換它會覆蓋其內容。";}s:7:"Restore";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"還原";}s:20:"Restore Default Keys";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"恢復預設密鑰";}s:185:"The VM failed to boot. This is possibly caused by not having an operating system installed or a misconfigured boot order. Maybe picking a guest OS install DVD will resolve the situation";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:167:"虛擬機器啟動失敗。這可能是由於未安裝作業系統或啟動順序配置錯誤造成的。或許選擇客戶作業系統安裝 DVD 可以解決問題。";}s:62:"The machine settings were changed while you were editing them.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:45:"在您編輯期間，機器設定已更改。";}s:67:"This folder already exists and possibly belongs to another machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:54:"此資料夾已存在，可能屬於另一台電腦。";}s:118:"This operation is equivalent to resetting or powering off the machine without doing a proper shutdown of the guest OS.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:84:"此操作相當於在未正確關閉客戶作業系統的情況下重設或關機。";}s:78:"This will cause any unsaved data in applications running inside it to be lost.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:75:"這將導致其中運行的應用程式中所有未保存的資料遺失。";}s:96:"Would you like to choose a virtual CD/DVD disk to put in the drive or to leave it empty for now?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:77:"您想選擇一個虛擬 CD/DVD 光碟放入光碟機，還是暫時留空？";}s:96:"Would you like to choose a virtual floppy disk to put in the drive or to leave it empty for now?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:69:"您要選擇一張虛擬軟碟放入驅動器，還是暫時留空？";}s:95:"Would you like to create a new, empty file to hold the disk contents or select an existing one?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:96:"您是想建立一個新的空文件來保存磁碟內容，還是選擇一個現有的文件？";}s:94:"Would you like to delete the files containing the virtual machine from your hard disk as well?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:63:"您是否也想從硬碟中刪除包含虛擬機器的檔案？";}s:74:"Would you like to reload the changed settings or to keep your own changes?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:72:"您想重新加載更改後的設置，還是保留您自己的更改？";}s:3:"Yes";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"是";}s:64:"You are about to add a new CD/DVD drive to controller <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:62:"您即將為控制器<b>%1</b>新增新的 CD/DVD 光碟機。";}s:64:"You are about to add a new floppy drive to controller <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:60:"您即將為控制器<b>%1</b>新增一個新的軟碟機。";}s:65:"You are about to add a virtual hard disk to controller <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:51:"您即將為控制器<b>%1</b>新增虛擬硬碟。";}s:262:"You are about to create a new virtual machine without a hard disk. You will not be able to install an operating system on the machine until you add one. In the mean time you will only be able to start the machine using a virtual optical disk or from the network.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:188:"您即將建立一個沒有硬碟的新虛擬機器。 在加入硬碟之前，您將無法在電腦上安裝作業系統。 同時，您只能使用虛擬光碟或從網路啟動電腦。";}s:77:"You are about to remove the following virtual machines from the machine list:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:54:"您即將從機器清單中刪除以下虛擬機器：";}s:50:"You are going to restore default secure boot keys.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"您將恢復預設安全啟動金鑰。";}s:43:"You currently have unsaved setting changes.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"您目前有未儲存的設定變更。";}}}s:16:"UIProgressDialog";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:1:{s:6:"Cancel";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"取消";}}}s:17:"UISnapshotDetails";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:41:{s:11:"%1 since %2";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"%1 自 %2";}s:10:"%n day ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"%n 天前";}s:11:"%n days ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:8:"n 天前";}s:11:"%n hour ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:11:"n 小時前";}s:12:"%n hours ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:11:"n 小時前";}s:13:"%n minute ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:11:"n 分鐘前";}s:14:"%n minutes ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"%n 分鐘前";}s:13:"%n second ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:8:"%n秒前";}s:14:"%n seconds ago";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"%n 秒前";}s:64:"Are you sure you want to delete the selected snapshot <b>%1</b>?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:48:"您確定要刪除選定的快照嗎<b>%1</b>？";}s:65:"Are you sure you want to restore snapshot <nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:52:"您確定要復原快照嗎<nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>？";}s:45:"Automatically start the machine after restore";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"恢復後自動啟動機器";}s:46:"Create a snapshot of the current machine state";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:33:"建立目前電腦狀態的快照";}s:13:"Current State";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"目前狀態";}s:23:"Current State (changed)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"目前狀態（已更改）";}s:15:"Delete Snapshot";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"刪除快照";}s:212:"Deleting the snapshot will cause the state information saved in it to be lost, and storage data spread over several image files that VirtualBox has created together with the snapshot will be merged into one file.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:159:"刪除快照會導致其中儲存的狀態資訊遺失，而 VirtualBox 與快照一起建立的多個映像檔中的儲存資料將合併到一個檔案中。";}s:12:"Description:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"描述：";}s:18:"Details of %1 (%2)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:23:"%1 (%2) 的詳細信息";}s:8:"Details:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:13:"詳細資料:";}s:89:"If you do not do this the current state will be permanently lost. Do you wish to proceed?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:81:"如果您不執行此操作，目前狀態將永久遺失。您是否要繼續？";}s:5:"Name:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"名稱:";}s:25:"Power off virtual machine";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"關閉虛擬機";}s:24:"Power on virtual machine";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"啟動虛擬機";}s:16:"Restore Snapshot";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"還原快照";}s:12:"Show Details";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"顯示詳情";}s:11:"Snapshot %1";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"快照 %1";}s:20:"Snapshot Description";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"快照描述";}s:13:"Snapshot Name";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"快照名稱";}s:32:"Take Snapshot of Virtual Machine";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"取得虛擬機器的快照";}s:52:"Take a snapshot of the current virtual machine state";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"取得目前虛擬機器狀態的快照";}s:11:"Taken at %1";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"取自 1%";}s:11:"Taken on %1";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:19:"已於 %1 處拍攝";}s:6:"Taken:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"已完成：";}s:71:"The current state differs from the state stored in the current snapshot";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:51:"目前狀態與目前快照中儲存的狀態不同";}s:74:"The current state is identical to the state stored in the current snapshot";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:57:"目前狀態與目前快照中儲存的狀態完全相同";}s:87:"This can be a lengthy process, and the information in the snapshot cannot be recovered.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:75:"這可能是一個漫長的過程，而且快照中的資訊無法恢復。";}s:57:"You are about to restore snapshot <nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:47:"您即將恢復快照 <nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>。";}s:102:"You can create a snapshot of the current state of the virtual machine first by checking the box below.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:81:"您可以先勾選下面的複選框，建立虛擬機器目前狀態的快照。";}s:7:"offline";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"離線";}s:6:"online";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"在線的";}}}s:9:"UIUSBMenu";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:1:{s:22:"<no devices available>";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:20:"<暫無可用設備>";}}}s:7:"UIUsers";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:16:{s:8:"Add User";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"新增用戶";}s:10:"Admin User";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"管理員用戶";}s:20:"Can administer users";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"可以管理用戶";}s:15:"Change Password";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"更改密碼";}s:9:"Edit User";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"編輯使用者";}s:29:"Invalid username or password.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:33:"使用者名稱或密碼無效。";}s:6:"Log in";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"登入";}s:12:"New Password";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"新密碼";}s:12:"Old Password";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"舊密碼";}s:8:"Password";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"密碼";}s:11:"Remove User";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"移除用戶";}s:6:"Retype";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"重新輸入";}s:41:"The password you have entered is invalid.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"您輸入的密碼無效。";}s:44:"The passwords you have entered do not match.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"您輸入的密碼不符。";}s:8:"Username";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"使用者名稱";}s:5:"Users";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"使用者";}}}s:11:"UIVMDesktop";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:6:{s:7:"Console";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"安慰";}s:7:"Details";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"詳細資料";}s:13:"Host Reources";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"主機資源";}s:10:"Loading...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"載入中...";}s:9:"Saving...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"儲存...";}s:9:"Snapshots";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"快照";}}}s:13:"UIVMLogViewer";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:2:{s:26:"%1 - VirtualBox Log Viewer";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:31:"%1 - VirtualBox 日誌檢視器";}s:100:"No log files found. Press the <b>Refresh</b> button to rescan the log folder <nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:98:"未找到日誌檔。請按<b>刷新</b>按鈕重新掃描日誌資料夾<nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>。";}}}s:17:"UIVMPreviewWindow";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:1:{s:18:"Open in new window";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"在新視窗中開啟";}}}s:21:"UIVirtualMediaManager";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:61:{s:7:"Actions";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"行動";}s:11:"Actual Size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"實際大小";}s:3:"Add";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"加入";}s:9:"Add iSCSI";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"新增 iSCSI";}s:53:"Are you sure you want to release the disk image file:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"您確定要發布磁碟映像檔嗎？";}s:91:"Are you sure you want to remove the %1 <nobr><b>%2</b></nobr> from the list of known media?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:75:"您確定要從已知媒體清單中刪除 %1 <nobr><b>%2</b></nobr> 嗎？";}s:12:"Attached to:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:10:"附加到:";}s:19:"Choose medium type:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"選擇媒介類型：";}s:7:"Copy...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"複製...";}s:12:"Description:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"描述：";}s:87:"Do you want to delete the storage unit of the virtual hard disk <nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>?";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:70:"您是否要刪除虛擬硬碟的儲存單元<nobr><b>%1</b></nobr>？";}s:7:"Encoded";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"編碼";}s:12:"Floppy disks";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"軟碟";}s:7:"Format:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"格式:";}s:10:"Hard disks";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"硬碟";}s:79:"Hard drive has children, <b>Writethrough</b> and <b>Shareable</b> not available";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:62:"硬碟有子項，<b>通寫</b> 和 <b>可分享</b> 不可用";}s:86:"Hard drive is attached to a VM, <b>Immutable</b> and <b>Multi-attach</b> not available";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:83:"硬碟已連接到虛擬機，<b>不可變</b>和<b>多重連線</b>功能不可用";}s:53:"Hard drive is dynamic, <b>Shareable</b> not available";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:43:"硬碟是動態的，<b>共享</b>不可用";}s:128:"If you select <b>Delete</b> then the specified storage unit will be permanently deleted. This operation <b>cannot be undone</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:107:"如果您選擇<b>刪除</b>，則指定的儲存單元將會永久刪除。此操作<b>無法撤銷</b>。";}s:215:"If you select <b>Keep</b> then the hard disk will be only removed from the list of known hard disks, but the storage unit will be left untouched which makes it possible to add this hard disk to the list later again.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:169:"如果您選擇<b>保留</b>，則硬碟只會從已知硬碟清單中刪除，但儲存單元將保持不變，這樣以後就可以再次將此硬碟新增至清單。";}s:9:"Immutable";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"不可更改的";}s:19:"Internal Networking";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"內部網路";}s:3:"LUN";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"星期一";}s:9:"Location:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"位置:";}s:18:"Medium attributes:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"中等屬性：";}s:99:"Medium is attached to a VM that is in state "Running", "Paused", or "Saved". Unable to copy medium.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:120:"媒體已附加至處於「運作中」、「已暫停」或「已儲存」狀態的虛擬機器。無法複製介質。";}s:102:"Medium is attached to a VM that is in state "Running", "Paused", or "Saved". Unable to release medium.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:120:"媒體已附加至處於「運作中」、「已暫停」或「已儲存」狀態的虛擬機器。無法釋放介質。";}s:24:"Modify medium attributes";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"修改媒介屬性";}s:9:"Modify...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"調整...";}s:12:"Multi-Attach";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"多重連接";}s:11:"MultiAttach";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"多重連接";}s:4:"Name";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"名稱";}s:3:"New";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"新的";}s:6:"Normal";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"普通的";}s:113:"Note that the storage unit of this medium will not be deleted and that it will be possible to use it later again.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:84:"請注意，此媒體的儲存單元不會被刪除，以後還可以再次使用。";}s:13:"Optical disks";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"光碟";}s:8:"Password";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"密碼";}s:95:"Please choose one of the following modes and press <b>%2</b> to proceed or <b>%3</b> otherwise.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:85:"請選擇以下模式之一，然後按 <b>%2</b> 繼續，或按 <b>%3</b> 繼續。";}s:4:"Port";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"港口";}s:8:"Readonly";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"只讀";}s:7:"Refresh";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"重新整理";}s:7:"Release";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"發布";}s:6:"Remove";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"移除";}s:12:"Rename File:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"重新命名檔案：";}s:6:"Select";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"選擇";}s:6:"Server";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"伺服器";}s:9:"Shareable";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"可分享";}s:4:"Size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"大小";}s:16:"Storage details:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"存儲裝置詳細資料:";}s:6:"Target";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"目標";}s:69:"This will detach it from the following virtual machine(s): <b>%2</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:63:"這將把它從以下虛擬機器中分離出來：<b>%2</b>。";}s:5:"Type:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"型態:";}s:5:"UUID:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:5:"UUID:";}s:8:"Username";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"使用者名稱";}s:70:"VM hard drive is attached to is running, cannot modify disk properties";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:69:"虛擬機器硬碟已連接，正在運行，無法修改磁碟屬性";}s:21:"Virtual Media Manager";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"虛擬媒體管理員";}s:12:"Virtual Size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"虛擬大小";}s:7:"Warning";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"警告";}s:8:"Warnings";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"警告";}s:12:"Writethrough";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"通寫";}s:70:"You are about to change the settings of the disk image file <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:53:"您即將變更磁碟映像檔 <b>%1</b> 的設定。";}}}s:8:"UIWizard";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:2:{s:11:"Expert Mode";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"專家模式";}s:11:"Guided Mode";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"引導模式";}}}s:15:"UIWizardCloneVM";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:31:{s:8:"%1 Clone";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"%1 再製";}s:5:"Clone";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"再製";}s:13:"Clone Options";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"克隆選項";}s:21:"Clone Virtual Machine";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"再製虛擬機器";}s:10:"Clone type";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"再製類型";}s:20:"Cloned Machine Name:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"克隆機器名稱：";}s:21:"Current machine state";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"目前機器狀態";}s:28:"Current snapshot tree branch";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"目前快照樹分支";}s:10:"Everything";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"一切";}s:10:"Full Clone";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"完全克隆";}s:51:"Generate new MAC addresses for all network adapters";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:41:"為所有網路卡產生新的 MAC 位址";}s:142:"If you choose <b>Current machine state</b>, the new machine will reflect the current state of the original machine and will have no snapshots.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:124:"如果您選擇<b>目前機器狀態</b>，則新機器將反映原始機器的當前狀態，並且不會有任何快照。";}s:246:"If you choose <b>Current snapshot tree branch</b>, the new machine will reflect the current state of the original machine and will have matching snapshots for all snapshots in the tree branch starting at the current state in the original machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:193:"如果您選擇<b>目前快照樹分支</b>，則新機器將反映原始機器的當前狀態，並且將具有與原始機器當前狀態開始的樹分支中的所有快照相符的快照。";}s:179:"If you choose <b>Everything</b>, the new machine will reflect the current state of the original machine and will have matching snapshots for all snapshots in the original machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:148:"如果您選擇<b>全部</b>，則新機器將反映原始機器的當前狀態，並且將具有與原始機器中的所有快照相符的快照。";}s:135:"If you choose <b>Full clone</b>, an exact copy (including all virtual hard disk files) of the original virtual machine will be created.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:121:"如果您選擇<b>完整複製</b>，則會建立原始虛擬機器的精確副本（包括所有虛擬硬碟檔案）。";}s:279:"If you choose <b>Linked clone</b>, a new machine will be created, but the virtual hard disk files will be tied to the virtual hard disk files of original machine and you will not be able to move the new virtual machine to a different computer without moving the original as well.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:226:"如果您選擇<b>連結複製</b>，將會建立一個新機器，但虛擬硬碟檔案將與原始機器的虛擬硬碟檔案綁定，您將無法在不移動原始機器的情況下將新虛擬機器移至另一台電腦。";}s:136:"If you create a <b>Linked clone</b>, then a new snapshot will be created in the original virtual machine as part of the cloning process.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:109:"如果您建立<b>連結複製</b>，則在複製過程中，將在原始虛擬機器中建立新的快照。";}s:41:"Include all network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:32:"包含所有網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:46:"Include only NAT network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:34:"只包含 NAT 網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:15:"Keep Disk Names";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"保留磁碟名稱";}s:19:"Keep Hardware UUIDs";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:17:"保留硬體 UUID";}s:25:"Linked Base for %1 and %2";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"%1 和 %2 連結的基礎";}s:12:"Linked Clone";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"連結克隆";}s:19:"MAC Address Policy:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"MAC位址策略：";}s:16:"New machine name";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"新機器名稱";}s:49:"Please choose a name for the new virtual machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"請為新的虛擬機器選擇名稱。";}s:51:"Please choose the type of clone you wish to create.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"請選擇您要建立的克隆類型。";}s:81:"Please choose which parts of the snapshot tree should be cloned with the machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:63:"請選擇要隨機器一起克隆的快照樹的哪些部分。";}s:9:"Snapshots";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"快照";}s:57:"The new machine will be a clone of the machine <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:45:"新機器將是機器<b>%1</b>的克隆版。";}s:9:"undefined";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"不明確的";}}}s:14:"UIWizardCopyVD";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:19:{s:7:"%1_copy";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"%1_複製";}s:219:"A <b>dynamically allocated</b> hard disk file will only use space on your physical hard disk as it fills up (up to a maximum <b>fixed size</b>), although it will not shrink again automatically when space on it is freed.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:159:"動態分配的硬碟檔案只會佔用實體硬碟上的空間（最大可達固定大小），但當硬碟上的空間被釋放時，它不會自動縮小。";}s:104:"A <b>fixed size</b> hard disk file may take longer to create on some systems but is often faster to use.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:114:"在某些系統上，建立固定大小的硬碟檔案可能需要更長時間，但使用起來通常會更快。";}s:42:"Choose a virtual hard disk file to copy...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:42:"選擇要複製到的虛擬硬碟檔案…";}s:43:"Choose a virtual hard drive file to copy...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"選擇要複製的虛擬硬碟檔案…";}s:4:"Copy";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"複製";}s:22:"Copy Virtual Hard Disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"複製虛擬硬碟";}s:21:"Dynamically allocated";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"動態分配";}s:10:"Fixed size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"固定尺寸";}s:19:"Hard disk file type";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"硬碟檔類型";}s:17:"Hard disk to copy";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"要複製的硬碟";}s:23:"New hard disk to create";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"要建立的新硬碟";}s:190:"Please choose the type of file that you would like to use for the new virtual hard disk. If you do not need to use it with other virtualization software you can leave this setting unchanged.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:142:"請選擇新的虛擬硬碟希望使用的檔案類型。 如果不需要用在其它虛擬化軟體，您可以保留這個設定不變更。";}s:163:"Please choose whether the new virtual hard disk file should grow as it is used (dynamically allocated) or if it should be created at its maximum size (fixed size).";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:123:"請選擇新的虛擬硬碟檔是否應根據使用來成長 (動態分配)，或建立為其最大大小 (固定大小)。";}s:193:"Please select the virtual hard disk file that you would like to copy if it is not already selected. You can either choose one from the list or use the folder icon beside the list to select one.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:156:"如果尚未選中，請選擇您要複製的虛擬硬碟檔案。您可以從清單中選擇，也可以使用清單旁邊的資料夾圖示進行選擇。";}s:153:"Please type the name of the new virtual hard disk file into the box below or click on the folder icon to select a different folder to create the file in.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:129:"請在以下的方塊中輸入新虛擬硬碟檔的名稱，或按一下資料夾圖示以選擇建立檔案的其它資料夾。";}s:33:"Split into files of less than 2GB";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:29:"分割成小於 2GB 的文件";}s:29:"Storage on physical hard disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"存儲裝置在實體硬碟";}s:252:"You can also choose to <b>split</b> the hard disk file into several files of up to two gigabytes each. This is mainly useful if you wish to store the virtual machine on removable USB devices or old systems, some of which cannot handle very large files.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:248:"您也可以選擇將硬碟文件<b>分割</b>成多個文件，每個文件最大可達 2 GB。如果您希望將虛擬機器儲存在可移動 USB 裝置或舊系統上，此功能尤其有用，因為某些裝置無法處理非常大的檔案。";}}}s:17:"UIWizardExportApp";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:34:{s:20:"Additional Settings:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"其他設定：";}s:25:"Appliance Export Settings";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"設備導出設定";}s:18:"Appliance settings";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"應用裝置設定";}s:11:"Description";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"描述";}s:6:"Export";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"匯出";}s:24:"Export Virtual Appliance";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"匯出虛擬應用裝置";}s:5:"File:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"文件：";}s:7:"Format:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"格式:";}s:116:"If you use an <b>ova</b> extension, then all the files will be combined into one Open Virtualization Format Archive.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:114:"如果您使用 <b>ova</b> 副檔名，則所有檔案將合併到一個 Open Virtualization Format Archive 中。";}s:77:"If you use an <b>ovf</b> extension, several files will be written separately.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:69:"如果使用 <b>ovf</b> 副檔名，則會分別寫入多個檔案。";}s:23:"Include ISO image files";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:23:"包含 ISO 鏡像文件";}s:41:"Include all network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:32:"包含所有網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:46:"Include only NAT network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:34:"只包含 NAT 網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:7:"License";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"授權";}s:19:"MAC Address Policy:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"MAC位址策略：";}s:4:"Name";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"名稱";}s:7:"OVF 0.9";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"OVF 0.9";}s:7:"OVF 1.0";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"OVF 1.0";}s:7:"OVF 2.0";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"OVF 2.0";}s:33:"Other extensions are not allowed.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:33:"不允許使用其他副檔名。";}s:50:"Please choose a filename to export the OVF/OVA to.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:37:"請選擇要匯出的OVF/OVA檔名。";}s:186:"Please select the virtual machines that should be added to the appliance. You can select more than one. Please note that these machines have to be turned off before they can be exported.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:141:"請選擇要新增至裝置的虛擬機器。您可以選擇多個虛擬機器。請注意，這些虛擬機器必須先關閉才能匯出。";}s:7:"Product";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"產品";}s:11:"Product-URL";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:10:"產品 URL";}s:16:"Restore Defaults";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"還原預設值";}s:33:"Select a directory to export into";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"選擇要匯出的目錄";}s:39:"Strip all network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:38:"移除所有網路介面卡 MAC 位址";}s:140:"This is the descriptive information which will be added to the virtual appliance.  You can change it by double clicking on individual lines.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:94:"這個描述性資訊將加入到虛擬應用裝置。 您可以按兩下各行來變更它。";}s:6:"Vendor";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"供應商";}s:10:"Vendor-URL";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:13:"供應商 URL";}s:7:"Version";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"版本";}s:26:"Virtual machines to export";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"匯出的虛擬機器";}s:19:"Write Manifest file";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"寫入清單文件";}s:9:"undefined";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"不明確的";}}}s:16:"UIWizardFirstRun";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:6:{s:37:"Choose a virtual optical disk file...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"選擇虛擬光碟檔...";}s:127:"Please select a virtual optical disk file or a physical optical drive containing a disk to start your new virtual machine from.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:93:"請選擇虛擬光碟檔案或包含光碟的實體光碟機來啟動您的新虛擬機器。";}s:20:"Select start-up disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"選擇啟動磁碟";}s:5:"Start";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"啟動";}s:343:"The disk should be suitable for starting a computer from and should contain the operating system you wish to install on the virtual machine if you want to do that now. The disk will be ejected from the virtual drive automatically next time you switch the virtual machine off, but you can also do this yourself if needed using the Devices menu.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:288:"該磁碟應適用於啟動計算機，並且如果您現在想在虛擬機上安裝作業系統，則應包含您希望安裝的作業系統。下次關閉虛擬機器時，磁碟將自動從虛擬磁碟機彈出，但您也可以根據需要使用「裝置」選單手動彈出磁碟。";}s:172:"The disk should be suitable for starting a computer from. As this virtual machine has no hard drive you will not be able to install an operating system on it at the moment.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:123:"該磁碟應該適合啟動計算機。由於這台虛擬機器沒有硬碟，目前您無法在其上安裝作業系統。";}}}s:17:"UIWizardImportApp";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:35:{s:19:"Additional Options:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"其他選項：";}s:18:"Appliance settings";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"應用裝置設定";}s:19:"Appliance to import";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"匯入的應用裝置";}s:3:"CPU";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"CPU";}s:44:"Choose a virtual appliance file to import...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:42:"選擇匯入的虛擬應用裝置檔案...";}s:3:"DVD";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"DVD";}s:11:"Description";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"描述";}s:6:"Floppy";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"軟碟";}s:51:"Generate new MAC addresses for all network adapters";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:41:"為所有網路卡產生新的 MAC 位址";}s:13:"Guest OS Type";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"客體作業系統類型";}s:6:"Import";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"匯入";}s:25:"Import Hard Drives as VDI";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:22:"將硬碟匯入為 VDI";}s:24:"Import Virtual Appliance";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"匯入虛擬應用裝置";}s:41:"Include all network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:32:"包含所有網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:46:"Include only NAT network adapter MAC addresses";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:34:"只包含 NAT 網路卡 MAC 位址";}s:19:"MAC Address Policy:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"MAC位址策略：";}s:4:"Name";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"名稱";}s:15:"Network Adapter";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"網路卡";}s:3:"RAM";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:3:"RAM";}s:49:"Reinitialize the MAC address of all network cards";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:44:"重新初始化所有網路卡的 MAC 位址";}s:16:"Restore Defaults";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"還原預設值";}s:29:"Select an appliance to import";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"選擇要進口的電器";}s:10:"Sound Card";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"音效卡";}s:24:"Storage Controller (IDE)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"存儲裝置控制器 (IDE)";}s:25:"Storage Controller (PCIe)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"儲存控制器（PCIe）";}s:24:"Storage Controller (SAS)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"存儲裝置控制器 (SAS)";}s:25:"Storage Controller (SATA)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:28:"存儲裝置控制器 (SATA)";}s:25:"Storage Controller (SCSI)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:28:"存儲裝置控制器 (SCSI)";}s:31:"Storage Controller (VirtioSCSI)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:34:"存儲裝置控制器 (VirtioSCSI)";}s:245:"These are the virtual machines contained in the appliance and the suggested settings of the imported VirtualBox machines. You can change many of the properties shown by double-clicking on the items and disable others using the check boxes below.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:205:"這些是包含在應用裝置的虛擬機器和匯入 VirtualBox 機器的建議設定。 您可以透過按兩下項目來變更顯示的許多內容，並使用以下的核取方塊停用其它內容。";}s:14:"USB Controller";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:13:"USB 控制器";}s:18:"Virtual Disk Image";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"虛擬磁碟映像";}s:17:"Virtual System %1";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"虛擬系統 %1";}s:143:"VirtualBox currently supports importing appliances saved in the Open Virtualization Format (OVF). To continue, select the file to import below.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:138:"VirtualBox 目前支援導入以開放虛擬化格式 (OVF) 儲存的虛擬裝置。若要繼續，請在下方選擇要匯入的檔案。";}s:9:"Warnings:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"警告:";}}}s:13:"UIWizardNewVD";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:27:{s:219:"A <b>dynamically allocated</b> hard disk file will only use space on your physical hard disk as it fills up (up to a maximum <b>fixed size</b>), although it will not shrink again automatically when space on it is freed.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:159:"動態分配的硬碟檔案只會佔用實體硬碟上的空間（最大可達固定大小），但當硬碟上的空間被釋放時，它不會自動縮小。";}s:104:"A <b>fixed size</b> hard disk file may take longer to create on some systems but is often faster to use.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:114:"在某些系統上，建立固定大小的硬碟檔案可能需要更長時間，但使用起來通常會更快。";}s:51:"Choose a location for new virtual hard disk file...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:36:"選擇新虛擬硬碟檔的位置...";}s:52:"Choose a location for new virtual hard drive file...";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"選擇新虛擬硬碟檔案的位置…";}s:6:"Create";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"建立";}s:24:"Create Virtual Hard Disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"建立虛擬硬碟";}s:21:"Dynamically allocated";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"動態分配";}s:13:"File location";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"文件位置";}s:22:"File location and size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"檔案位置和大小";}s:9:"File size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"文件大小";}s:10:"Fixed size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"固定尺寸";}s:25:"HDD (Parallels Hard Disk)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"HDD（Parallels 硬碟）";}s:19:"Hard disk file type";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"硬碟檔類型";}s:8:"Location";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"位置";}s:190:"Please choose the type of file that you would like to use for the new virtual hard disk. If you do not need to use it with other virtualization software you can leave this setting unchanged.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:142:"請選擇新的虛擬硬碟希望使用的檔案類型。 如果不需要用在其它虛擬化軟體，您可以保留這個設定不變更。";}s:163:"Please choose whether the new virtual hard disk file should grow as it is used (dynamically allocated) or if it should be created at its maximum size (fixed size).";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:123:"請選擇新的虛擬硬碟檔是否應根據使用來成長 (動態分配)，或建立為其最大大小 (固定大小)。";}s:153:"Please type the name of the new virtual hard disk file into the box below or click on the folder icon to select a different folder to create the file in.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:129:"請在以下的方塊中輸入新虛擬硬碟檔的名稱，或按一下資料夾圖示以選擇建立檔案的其它資料夾。";}s:25:"QCOW (QEMU Copy-On-Write)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"QCOW（QEMU 寫時複製）";}s:24:"QED (QEMU enhanced disk)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:25:"QED（QEMU增強磁碟）";}s:167:"Select the size of the virtual hard disk in megabytes. This size is the limit on the amount of file data that a virtual machine will be able to store on the hard disk.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:146:"選取虛擬硬碟的大小 (以 MB 位元組為單位)。 這個大小是對虛擬機器將能夠存儲在硬碟上的檔案資料量的限制。";}s:33:"Split into files of less than 2GB";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:29:"分割成小於 2GB 的文件";}s:29:"Storage on physical hard disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:27:"存儲裝置在實體硬碟";}s:27:"VDI (VirtualBox Disk Image)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:32:"VDI（VirtualBox 磁碟映像）";}s:23:"VHD (Virtual Hard Disk)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"VHD（虛擬硬碟）";}s:27:"VMDK (Virtual Machine Disk)";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:28:"VMDK（虛擬機器磁碟）";}s:252:"You can also choose to <b>split</b> the hard disk file into several files of up to two gigabytes each. This is mainly useful if you wish to store the virtual machine on removable USB devices or old systems, some of which cannot handle very large files.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:248:"您也可以選擇將硬碟文件<b>分割</b>成多個文件，每個文件最大可達 2 GB。如果您希望將虛擬機器儲存在可移動 USB 裝置或舊系統上，此功能尤其有用，因為某些裝置無法處理非常大的檔案。";}s:9:"undefined";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:12:"不明確的";}}}s:13:"UIWizardNewVM";a:1:{s:8:"messages";a:18:{s:6:"Create";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"建立";}s:22:"Create Virtual Machine";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:18:"建立虛擬機器";}s:30:"Create a virtual hard disk now";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"立即建立虛擬硬碟";}s:30:"Do not add a virtual hard disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:24:"不要添加虛擬硬碟";}s:9:"Hard disk";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:6:"硬碟";}s:138:"If you need a more complex storage set-up you can skip this step and make the changes to the machine settings once the machine is created.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:111:"如果您需要更複雜的儲存設置，您可以跳過此步驟，並在建立機器後變更機器設定。";}s:63:"If you wish you can add a virtual hard disk to the new machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:57:"如果需要，您可以為新機器新增虛擬硬碟。";}s:11:"Memory size";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:15:"記憶體大小";}s:25:"Name and operating system";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:21:"名稱和作業系統";}s:5:"Name:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"名稱:";}s:210:"Please choose a descriptive name for the new virtual machine and select the type of operating system you intend to install on it. The name you choose will be used throughout VirtualBox to identify this machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:180:"請為新的虛擬機器選擇一個描述性名稱，並選擇您打算在其上安裝的作業系統類型。您選擇的名稱將在 VirtualBox 中用於識別此虛擬機器。";}s:86:"Select the amount of memory (RAM) in megabytes to be allocated to the virtual machine.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:87:"選擇要分配給虛擬機器的記憶體（RAM）量（以兆位元組為單位）。";}s:44:"The recommended memory size is <b>%1 MB</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:39:"建議記憶體大小為<b>%1 MB</b>。";}s:51:"The recommended size of the hard disk is <b>%1</b>.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:36:"建議的硬碟容量為<b>%1</b>。";}s:5:"Type:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:7:"型態:";}s:38:"Use an existing virtual hard disk file";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:33:"使用現有的虛擬硬碟文件";}s:8:"Version:";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:9:"版本：";}s:118:"You can either create a new hard disk file or select one from the list or from another location using the folder icon.";a:1:{s:11:"translation";s:117:"您可以建立一個新的硬碟文件，也可以使用資料夾圖示從清單或其他位置選擇一個文件。";}}}}}